{"version":1,"content":"<p>在首款摺疊屏手機iPhone Duo上市後不久，部分用户反映鉸鏈區域出現問題，導致內屏出現裂紋。蘋果公司現已就相關報告作出回應。在發給MacRumors的一份聲明中，蘋果表示只有「極少數」設備受到影響，但並未説明開裂的具體成因，也沒有透露是否計劃推出修複方案。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583948.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T18:00:30.187700+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T17:48:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T17:58:08.247462+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T17:58:08.247462+00:00","content_hash":"06ce045774b707cf1e6ebcc36c0117a290f276a304b4ce3d9fb6803ba5ce52f2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}